                  {
                    "texto": "Of course. Can we sit together?"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "quien": "mom",
                "texto": "I don't know. There's nothing on the plate. Only a fork."
              },
              {
                "quien": "bryan",
                "reglaIds": [
                  31
                ],
                "opciones": [
                  {
                    "texto": "I didn't see anybody in the kitchen.",
                    "ok": true
